{"request_id": "60a90c6fcf69", "t_ms": 836.7, "event": "verify_end", "ok": true, "is_refusal": false, "problems": [], "raw": "The original Transformer applies **post\u2011normalization** after each sub\u2011layer, i.e., a normalization layer is placed *after* the residual addition within each block. H\u2011Net notes that modern large language models use **pre\u2011normalization**: they place a final normalization layer (e.g., RMSNorm) *after* all residual blocks, before the next sub\u2011layer, to balance feature norms and signal propagation [hnet p.8]."}
